WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.678
Key takeaway EA and PA roles can overlap Executive

00:00:04.718 --> 00:00:07.744
access does not give you a chief-of-staff or specialist

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:11.783
mandate Refer a decision to its appointed owner while

00:00:11.796 --> 00:00:14.033
helping the legitimate task move forward
